/* Tsh170 - ShapeAnalysis_Shell.CheckOrientedShells with-zero-tolerance
 * Defect: CheckOrientedShells called with tolerance=0; ambiguity in
 * adjacent-face matching when edges are exactly coincident.
 * Tests: shell with two adjacent faces, edges exactly touching. */
HEADER;
